      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "6c59fa296bf61cd62cae9c7b56ffac3a72ccd5eb3917ea9d6eec263ddcafe71e",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "02acd5c550e216d179d81a384c2edbb654268ba5ea8d8eca205c780fe310cae0",
      "text": "Memory and Steering",
      "hash": "e9396c915a0fb1c9f188708920573d4a5b1ec0a09639049682989999ecbdf3de"
    },
    {
      "id": "df0b6771e7f84a50c3d7eaf8bd148b8bd69b558383546ece0b9dee872227df73",
      "text": "Context pointer",
      "hash": "d95bc371d100339c0ab85461467e2c00939ce2b4d26a5c74d8a927ccfab4b271"
    },
    {
      "id": "6e890989c00cb4f65f659888b3075ffcaa46ee1df4d849b1cd558ebddc86b320",
      "text": "A mention in one document that points to another, so the agent can pull it into context only when the task calls for it.",
      "hash": "c5c3d458259d658ef5d90434a86ac39a4779b384a900f44b9b6bafae0534dbfa"
    },
    {
      "id": "fb1b7e564154e9218fececfb549f91d750e99d7befaa0852b9dd591f0ffff3b8",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "873f62543c74b0f3fbd472043187ee6323c8119ae102614c3a87a805e5bbcca4",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "c74c2e5cb2d24ba6f16d0252afbc6e86d68f75390e736f9bbae3a8c6d99a7b69",
      "text": "A mention in one document that points to another, so the",
      "hash": "e8ee5eec96b3ae1ccc4c4c4d5a9394fef242f39f3b0f88787d0faa2a986b885c"
    },
    {
      "id": "d247374770be964db51a2fd058535ad2eb76b2d3f42c343a4b4ee82741f4a587",
      "text": "can pull it into the",
      "hash": "cae3711c19139be90fb95aa4c125edbedcd7346c6d745d75c6cb4208048ebc39"
    },
    {
      "id": "00eca3153022442189f6eb200eefca68420d99ed2a919d80224a721040aa1480",
      "text": "context window",
      "hash": "6764434518d37f01df452fe2af0af3f314f8c27a72519001ea14189c5ee42476"
    },
    {
      "id": "2bbfd551ea8cee21129710e9ca37ba338be8fa72f49e87620f34a4cab3e3431d",
      "text": "only when the task calls for it. The unit",
      "hash": "55f6fa95d5331cc7bf9563191c670d625a5104958e71d88ebebd8c06160d791e"
    },
    {
      "id": "ecca2d75841e12bf942043b329c2c0e114aa7e0cd53de773bef4846a303da66d",
      "text": "progressive disclosure",
      "hash": "6da46646b127888c91f582c85bba28941b74cdb2da40e92e62e2157d47644c4c"
    },
    {
      "id": "eb3529974f8b95814abf4988d6503f9a00de3393e9d65f9c542b2cd787b5bba9",
      "text": "is built from.",
      "hash": "861d84fbfd2dde9276531f9d97595aa2f7845340adaf0fc39ac69df32dfa3b64"
    },
    {
      "id": "a33e3744a086745f21cc5c43d6b91c03402b91c832b2d5b4dc55fd8e50b8ace3",
      "text": "The reason to use a pointer (instead of inlining the content) is cost. A pointer is one line in the context window. The document behind it might be thousands of",
      "hash": "6a27833ad6406331d57c144bb54d36ea673b20d0e499335e5640ab4e873d2bd1"
    },
    {
      "id": "87c41c471742a3d57d8fd8cbe7b82befbc4d60cdbd61af4952319970d5b79b47",
      "text": ", but those tokens cost nothing until the agent actually follows the pointer. Inline a 2,000-token runbook in",
      "hash": "73dc003d16d584c764b88f87ac400055168bfc50f7b9c38ba3ea309c31d37cab"
    },
    {
      "id": "1a1fe979d799be868c2dd9dafd579b5f7d9dd54e51087fb44400544d343a38af",
      "text": "and every",
      "hash": "da84e4451da91188332045444f5184eb518f14d9f829c4645dea4f5dc5a86bd0"
    },
    {
      "id": "3328f2759c3842aa3be73d9459b21f006a9a4e30dfed252321b6eea4b199eed0",
      "text": "pays for it; replace it with \"deploy process: see",
      "hash": "656d7491a7971487a7c21efd4bbb7d41c949087673bb8072873f6f293dccf15f"
    },
    {
      "id": "82993af7c0675af02c027dad22a28c55fe9ea9bacd4bdb46e7f893e50fa2c7fc",
      "text": "\" and only the sessions that deploy ever load it. The agent follows the pointer with a",
      "hash": "649948a1deef25a9e4f296a39ed96231410d38a4b3d9d2e2fedc9e7e8f54cf5e"
    },
    {
      "id": "760435522510ea67bb64573166c022cd103567aadeed155134dca09bbf6962bc",
      "text": "tool call",
      "hash": "56e7059d39717d558a3cd6526f07f33310ec6c83132c1f7692a9fc3a37684573"
    },
    {
      "id": "98e9d78bef17949b3f7326dfe3f3975516c5529e62af5a6e7f65a05543233eea",
      "text": "when the task matches.",
      "hash": "e40b94dd29db168e794ed7c53859d34386396988b3340cf59bb94244dee9088b"
    },
    {
      "id": "7ce5eb4bf66d2a1abcd0f5cf0ef476ba89d7970e1ae1d641618573eb2c1cff94",
      "text": "A pointer needs two parts to work: a stable path, and enough description for the agent to know when following it is worth it. A bare path is a pointer the agent has no reason to follow; \"see",
      "hash": "3a79915d40d62e7cbaeda3c78e52a8a376e5bd6038e18a84ea59aef91c2735ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "dcc8978fbd9bd4d8afb8bee5a7ee270c4df8137a6a337659f81a1dffa9eeace1",
      "text": "\" with no hint of what's inside gets skipped by a session that needed it. Write the line so it matches how tasks present: \"release, deploy, or rollback — read",
      "hash": "ee858026f80d0a6b8f8aaf299e991809c3974a9c993625fdd2f8ae44d65efad6"
    },
    {
      "id": "ff0c2ed45ba7eaafe66dad90bf797ea6e9e497acdaff64225a5c40974dbf3351",
      "text": "first\".",
      "hash": "97f195b79799a53f73bd52fa756387eb9c845c65cbe5041139471c9eca65c887"
    },
    {
      "id": "2c6a4d0970e2ddbe0d21c20be3aca87f81fddf6f024e128af5c6049bef678480",
      "text": "Pointers are everywhere once you look: lines in AGENTS.md,",
      "hash": "b3138938826367248c5c53d5a2d34daa10656ca26e6985cd4b480de859808751"
    },
    {
      "id": "8837c456c57a6a2a5ddb4efc4d837cc4965c7b9c6cd11033ad733e816790e5a1",
      "text": "descriptions (the harness loads the description; the skill body waits behind it), filenames in a directory listing, links between docs.",
      "hash": "674468984788af7ae73351124e8d5ddbbd74c6ee3c0b81db2df048b7be410091"
    },
    {
      "id": "a134ab1080436f15000be12fc71d834010fa7c5b6e8c96a51c4eec72e5c19d33",
      "text": "A pointer can also tie a",
      "hash": "9adc545acca5f265fa0dc69b01653903a663fe8e9000343a3335c101c9e16eb7"
    },
    {
      "id": "315a8ac6127b2ccf4fa4ba7b7d0000a4aae0f653a5de7c81fe4b3b5642fc32e6",
      "text": "secondary source",
      "hash": "130ab3f910dec4f94436851c6b9a50abec9e6cb96e7aadf7c47be2e57da1c894"
    },
    {
      "id": "9f954f76b58d932ed341167bad86b43b76aad08fecc1c1de9b2fd5425b0482c6",
      "text": "back to the",
      "hash": "9689362403ad463c112a0e87c93c93277546e805af16d5d31c66c04c869570f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "42eca41ea14e0fedca7df7579eb59fcb526359b48fa62c66d5daba12a84be766",
      "text": "primary source",
      "hash": "4c3f03bb625194b79deeff56ee12d13258ff531de6eef1fff5529d0fe89a1404"
    },
    {
      "id": "f32b1a90220318dcbfdb29abf9266d7271a0a944cfa88434f57d32de12c938fd",
      "text": "it was derived from — the compaction summary that names the original transcript, the doc that names the source file it describes. This makes the secondary source's lossiness recoverable: when the summary turns out not to be enough, the agent follows the pointer and reads the original, instead of working from whatever the summary kept.",
      "hash": "2a417bdcf51dc9309a5f0bea421f0c46346964ace845e1e68090181dd7aa3805"
    },
    {
      "id": "c84d70b7e097a5a28e98423316f8b69f72c40da64543f268e608cb6d11bba3fd",
      "text": "Avoid:",
      "hash": "0c98d3dd1920fdb71269240ba1ce3a7323099760ecd0b295f071aca6b07e30df"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5d8556460b204bf1f96e75c992cca353f6e59581627fb76b76552df7fadc5a5",
      "text": "\"reference\" — too dry; doesn't convey that following it pulls more context in. \"Portal\" — too florid.",
      "hash": "d8b5631ebb0a7fb4d2958e233e66f82a972c611e2d29fc58ab6b6f39460d1478"
    },
    {
      "id": "4b10c6f2f381ec83251750fe741fd3ab19fee4402fd90ddd577a85dd7249cce5",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "34759286d1f8156d7978c7e023bf812b5f29d6950b6a02e76f46da24fb92e671",
      "text": "\"AGENTS.md is getting huge.\"",
      "hash": "4d2f0bebbe739103d4632e45c9239b36483a7cc74d84dfbf65d64a6fdfc5b5f5"
    },
    {
      "id": "18887dab73656976cfd879f19f2aac1fafcda7b15bebbe593f51ac0daca9bdd5",
      "text": "\"Most of it should be context pointers, not content. Keep the always-on rules inline; turn the deploy runbook and the style guide into skills and leave a context pointer behind.\"",
      "hash": "911dedac48aebad24582f75d4e40c72812f876c3f8ff15c01f020482d33ad790"
    },
    {
      "id": "2fe9fc707979d197ce2ed10650e87b633150744f2ec59149d03713a7c0db25fb",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "44dcd7af2a5c79cea14681f3ebfc6b8ff5edd4526ef7b027e8747eaba3e524d3",
      "text": "Progressive disclosure",
      "hash": "cc1b70611c98675e8e42c8d6246c2f13f869540b48c6abd18713bd25ecc7611b"
    },
    {
      "id": "eb4019a8e77683e616bd7f4438993200d0f356c359dc256ee18deb90297375a8",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "7f694460d8bf47cd22b76019b7a46d368a2a472c1df68b86d561a9995cf4d52c",
      "text": "Skill",
      "hash": "6df1bb18a59ab97df82e307b93fe4f3bbda34d531bcbb79ec573dda23ba64918"
    },
    {
      "id": "9871451f975316a18bfdcd745140d0e38850767d89756a32fcd0e736c189cb66",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "c06e9b4f0371d4a0750a2277f27d2774be51b721fca888f834d46b5f15a1243e",
      "text": "Join AI Hero for practical skills, thinking on AI engineering, and resources that keep you ahead of the curve.",
      "hash": "a082f7147e30da6afe92268d5668a530edfff13e64934f8f63f22c098db86133"
    },
    {
      "id": "2689bd88f33705141ccbe7a356d12394600495a6d9e35c5538e63d19daad8053",
      "text": "First Name",
      "hash": "96ce6e6193a047260f5c32aa416d88b6e8959111f43f98457af9cc009a0907ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "8cd039a673661a501338444f5c9902478f9a2a9fada855053744741382428193",
      "text": "Email*",
      "hash": "61dff02026341a6e553a56fc2ba214a76ad68c18cc67bf732993cfdbd51bb8b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "05f0b96b3472e5972337f6c790d16a71d1e574374e6fdb2fafb9b74cd683432c",
      "text": "Get AI Hero updates",
      "hash": "81b46eab414c141d6dcd85a5bd534179bf54a3532469436d693c437e9de3a90a"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5d999c94217f7aeed43ffb0196fe093db44b2db0a3d35f0265464a4c67059dc",
      "text": "No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.",
      "hash": "461f8758206b36fd4ddfaf6740b33dc0de41c9c7acb9121525993b781d5e18bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "b09bc10603d628d4aad6fa8180693d86e34dbe73d1f7f4a04783cdc68dd838be",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "2a6fe965516c8a329b04546a6c0c3973a513ec312ee727e536881587852d2573",
      "text": "Copy URL",
      "hash": "b26d1037f1c2da31a0296d915982f12049f91bfedb998b105ce967b73a796699"
    },
    {
      "id": "5f6093ebebc2e8ae6655361f9714061275ca40a1126993751c7b8b92fd121a49",
      "text": "Learn",
      "hash": "ce78afd0e6a225ecac96a6812b9d192e7eb35889cd5237beb38b50375b79d8dd"
    },
    {
